{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it. Analyze its properties. If not, explore. Repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = AnalyzeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    />",
